      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kimmswick%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Kimmswick Apple Butter Festival is an annual fall celebration that draws over 100,000 visitors each year.",
